Original Statement:
------------------
SELECT 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_NET_PAID_INC_SHIP_TAX,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DOW 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES 
  INNER JOIN TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 
  ON TPCDS.DATE_DIM2.D_DATE_SK = TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK 
WHERE 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_ITEM_SK >= 16111 AND 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES.WS_LIST_PRICE >= +00006.07


Optimized Statement:
-------------------
SELECT 
  Q1.WS_NET_PAID_INC_SHIP_TAX AS "WS_NET_PAID_INC_SHIP_TAX",
  Q2.D_DOW AS "D_DOW" 
FROM 
  TPCDS.WEB_SALES AS Q1,
  TPCDS.DATE_DIM2 AS Q2 
WHERE 
  (Q2.D_DATE_SK = Q1.WS_SHIP_DATE_SK) AND 
  (+00006.07 <= Q1.WS_LIST_PRICE) AND 
  (16111 <= Q1.WS_ITEM_SK)

Explain level:    Explain from section

